# About 80 User

This directory is what makes the generic system *yours*: your profile, your preferences, your privacy boundaries, your onboarding state, and the optional files that tell the AI how you write and how you work. Files here are private by default and are read before anything else you own. Setup creates most of them for you; the rest are optional hooks that do nothing until they exist. `System/Documentation/Human User Manual.md` §8 walks through every file in here and what each one changes.
